WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.262
Stein's conjecture for Lipschitz fields.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.515
At each point a direction, turning smoothly. Integrate

3
00:00:05.515 --> 00:00:07.804
along the short segment at each point.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.630
Bound each frequency band, then glue the bands back with a commutator.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.917
Claimed: bounded, uniformly, at short scales.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.227
Main theorem Lean-checked.
